<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρῖφ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρῖπος</span>
			, <i>fishing-basket, creel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.47
			</span></i>Id, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				486
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., <i>anything intricate, dark saying,
			riddle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				153
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.448b
			</span></i> sqq.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. προβάλλειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					74.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγειν γρίφους παρὰ πότον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					124.2
				</span></i>
			; distd. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴνιγμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>forfeit paid</i> for failing to guess a riddle, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
